What this repository adds
-------------------------
  * A4 PDF layout rebuilt from the authors' own Word sources: clickable table of
    contents with page numbers, 22 PDF bookmarks, running headers and footers,
    all 37 original figures, compressed 17 MB -> 8.9 MB.
  * Two WorkBuddy/Claude skills (zh / en) that reorganise the handbook into
    on-demand reference files.

Known deviations from the original (see README for detail)
----------------------------------------------------------
  1. Chapter 12 (Related Works) — the original page was an interactive component and
     could not be captured in early versions. It has since been rebuilt in full from
     the author's Word source, so no supplement text remains.
  2. Chapters 01-08 figures — originals were canvas-rendered and unobtainable; the
     diagrams in this repo are redrawn schematics, labelled "示意图", not the
     originals.

